{"id":"452070","name":"益母草鸡腿汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/452070/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"益母草","amount":"4棵"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"鸡腿肉","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"去皮鸡腿肉去肥油和筋膜，飞水，洗净。","img":"images/452070/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣洗净去核。","img":"images/452070/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"益母草洗净，切长段。","img":"images/452070/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把以上材料放入大沙锅(或小汤锅)，大火烧开，转小火煲30分钟。","img":"images/452070/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋煮熟，剥壳。","img":"images/452070/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入汤中继续煲30分钟。","img":"images/452070/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放盐调味即可。","img":"images/452070/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"补血养颜。","img":"images/452070/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}